# Kconfig.projbuild — 构建模式选择
#
# RID_SCANNER_BUILD_SIMULATOR=n (默认): 纯侦测构建
#   - crid_simulator 组件不参与编译链接
#   - 开机直接进入侦测模式（或显示侦测启动画面）
#   - 二进制最小，WiFi/BLE 共存最稳定
#
# RID_SCANNER_BUILD_SIMULATOR=y: 模拟发射构建
#   - 编译 crid_simulator 组件
#   - 开机显示菜单可选择模拟发射模式
#   - 适用于第二块板（S3 或 C5）做信号源

menu "RID Scanner Build Options"

    config RID_SCANNER_BUILD_SIMULATOR
        bool "Build with simulator support"
        default n
        help
            Enable RID simulator (signal transmitter) component.
            When disabled, the firmware is detector-only with minimal
            binary size and optimal WiFi/BLE coexistence.

endmenu
